  "specific_issues": [
    "A hand warmer is being passed under a table. The actual passer, recipient and passing object/table scopes must remain explicit; neither heat, winter nor caring intent follows from the object name. Actual passer/recipient identities and same-versus-distinct endpoint topology are missing. Existing-only application is proposed, not selected; root must preserve actual intended handoff without inventing second person, hands or count.",
