    "A market lane includes restrained bystander stares as a social cue. The exact staring members and target remain unspecified, so no main-scene-subject gaze target is invented. Actual participating members/independent gaze scopes, stare target and existing-versus-introduction choice are unresolved. Contextual social meaning is supported, but missing exact gaze target prevents direct gaze_target role. No optimistic target default.",
